# J0b: the same fabric probe under FABRIC_1D_RING (only after J0 passed; resets first)
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the TP4 bring-up (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env, commit, and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig,
# a card or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time.
# Duration (estimate, wall clock; the workflow's step limits in parentheses): reset 3-12 min, fabric 8-25 min: about 20-40 min.
# FABRIC_1D is what the TT plugin sets; the ring fabric config is the alternative to try if the Ring collectives under FABRIC_1D are slower than the probe says the links allow.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset fabric
C2_IMAGE_TAG=s2-6a10e85
C2_PROFILE=general-tp4
C2_FABRIC=FABRIC_1D_RING
